# AVD-GCP-0001: GCS media bucket is intentionally public for serving static media files
# The nosilha-com-media-storage bucket requires public read access for:
# - User-uploaded images displayed on the site
# - Static media assets served directly to browsers
# Security is maintained through:
# - Uniform bucket-level access (no ACLs)
# - Write access restricted to authenticated backend service account only
AVD-GCP-0001

